{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/0101da251622458a792fd4f71104550a.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Major League Fishing\u00ae: Pro Catch -\u00a0</strong>the ultimate fishing adventure that blends lifelike simulation with thrilling competition. Whether you're an elite angler or a weekend hobbyist, get ready to experience the most immersive fishing sim ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/ee679eedd9efec539a94a6d9ccd8aca8.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with authentic gear from <strong>Mossy Oak\u00ae, Abu Garcia\u00ae, Fenwick\u00ae, Hardy\u00ae, Pflueger\u00ae, Greys\u00ae, Berkley\u00ae, Duckett Fishing\u00ae, Lew's\u00ae, Strike King\u00ae, Zebco\u00ae</strong>\u00a0and more. Customize rods, reels, baits, and tackle boxes to match your style. Upgrade your boat and sonar to gain the competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5b140ac32e5568c7d870a12f8d484262.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the globe, from crystal-clear alpine lakes to deep-sea fishing hotspots. Every location features stunning visuals, dynamic weather, and ecosystems filled with realistic fish behavior and hidden gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b421dcafecab7753434797b665978c3a.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bass, trout, marlin, and monstrous deep-sea predators- every fish is a challenge. With different fish AI and behaviors, each catch is always a challenge! Sharpen your technique and master the art of fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5f3f3d14cfeb41896a6779ed977c4bff.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill in solo mode or join global multiplayer tournaments. Compete with friends, share your biggest catches, or climb the online leaderboards as part of your fishing crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b620e26e2aefc83ef3efdcbb5d3b1d28.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic environments, responsive casting, and a full day-night cycle, <strong>MLF: Pro Catch</strong> offers a satisfying blend of hardcore realism and arcade-style fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/9401b2ffe6269ce77d24bcb25410f749.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Join fast-paced, skill-based tournaments for a shot at <strong>real-world rewards</strong>\u00a0- exclusive gear, leaderboard glory, and bragging rights. It\u2019s easy to enter, tough to master, and always worth the fight.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1307150?t=1776748715","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/7b337b53541a256633cb5f637e0371c9bdcef896/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776748715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/e8a25f8a378fe595948e9194e856df9640cf7f56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776748715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/e8a25f8a378fe595948e9194e856df9640cf7f56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776748715","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>GEAR UP WITH REAL BRANDS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5980014a3a72af530c5488c3a43d5b30.avif?t=1776748715\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/0101da251622458a792fd4f71104550a.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Major League Fishing\u00ae: Pro Catch -\u00a0</strong>the ultimate fishing adventure that blends lifelike simulation with thrilling competition. Whether you're an elite angler or a weekend hobbyist, get ready to experience the most immersive fishing sim ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/ee679eedd9efec539a94a6d9ccd8aca8.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with authentic gear from <strong>Mossy Oak\u00ae, Abu Garcia\u00ae, Fenwick\u00ae, Hardy\u00ae, Pflueger\u00ae, Greys\u00ae, Berkley\u00ae, Duckett Fishing\u00ae, Lew's\u00ae, Strike King\u00ae, Zebco\u00ae</strong>\u00a0and more. Customize rods, reels, baits, and tackle boxes to match your style. Upgrade your boat and sonar to gain the competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5b140ac32e5568c7d870a12f8d484262.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the globe, from crystal-clear alpine lakes to deep-sea fishing hotspots. Every location features stunning visuals, dynamic weather, and ecosystems filled with realistic fish behavior and hidden gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b421dcafecab7753434797b665978c3a.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bass, trout, marlin, and monstrous deep-sea predators- every fish is a challenge. With different fish AI and behaviors, each catch is always a challenge! Sharpen your technique and master the art of fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5f3f3d14cfeb41896a6779ed977c4bff.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill in solo mode or join global multiplayer tournaments. Compete with friends, share your biggest catches, or climb the online leaderboards as part of your fishing crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b620e26e2aefc83ef3efdcbb5d3b1d28.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic environments, responsive casting, and a full day-night cycle, <strong>MLF: Pro Catch</strong> offers a satisfying blend of hardcore realism and arcade-style fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/9401b2ffe6269ce77d24bcb25410f749.avif?t=1776748715\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Join fast-paced, skill-based tournaments for a shot at <strong>real-world rewards</strong>\u00a0- exclusive gear, leaderboard glory, and bragging rights. It\u2019s easy to enter, tough to master, and always worth the fight.</p>","developers":["Ultimate Games S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/ce37d2f8fa0d4221bee6cefa3e7bb23586984b72/header.jpg?t=1776748715","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Playworks Partners. All rights reserved. <br>Developed by Ultimate Games S.A., Ultimate Games S.A. and its logo are trademarks of Ultimate Games S.A. All Rights Reserved. <br><br>All third-party trademarks and brand names shown on this page are the property of their respective owners and are used with permission where applicable. This includes, 